ZS + DocRED (Qwen) & $-$8.25 & +0.49 & $+\infty$ & \checkmark \\
ZS + DocRED (Llama) & $-$23.52 & +0.29 & $+\infty$ & \checkmark \\
FT + SciERC & $\sim$0 & $<$0.1 & $\approx\infty$ & \checkmark \\
